## General Rules & Arena Services

- **Timing & Punching:** SportIdent AIR+ touch-free (SIAC). SIAC hire fee 50 SEK/day (unreturned SIAC charged at 1,000 SEK). Secondary SIAC backup is permitted.
- **Race Numbers:** The same handlebar race number is used for all three competitions. Attached with cable ties and collected at the arena.
- **Start Procedure:** Timed start with a 3-minute call-up time. Box 1 (Check in), Box 2 (SIAC TEST), Box 3 (Map collected 1 min before start).
- **Results:** Live results available during the races. Final official results published on Eventor, Winsplits, and Livelox.
- **Arena Facilities:** Toilets, showers, bike wash, well-stocked cafeteria (Swish/cash), and map holder rental (50 SEK/day).
- **Organising Committee:**
  - Race Director: Lars Pontén, IF Thor (`lars.ponten@gmail.com`)
  - Event Controller: Patrik Svedberg
  - Event Jury: Peter Albinsson (IFK Enskede), Cissi Lingerud (OK Skogsfalken), Sara Forsgren (OK Nolaskogsarna)

---

## Food Bulletin & Championship Dinner

Food pre-orders must be completed by **Tuesday 11 August at 23:39** via Eventor for each respective event.

- **Saturday Lunch (Arena OK Linné):** Hearty homemade soup with sandwich (regular or vegetarian), 85 SEK. Pre-order via [Eventor Middle](https://eventor.orientering.se/Events/Show/57105).
- **Saturday Afternoon (Arena SLU):** Light cafeteria service at the arena.
- **Saturday Evening Dinner (17:30–21:00):** Drop-in dinner at Ulls Restaurant (Duhrevägen 8, Ultuna). Prize giving for Middle and Sprint held during the evening. Menu: Beef stroganoff with rice and pickles, three types of salads, bread, drinks, coffee/tea, and cake. Price: 250 SEK/person (children under 12: 150 SEK). Register via [Eventor Sprint](https://eventor.orientering.se/Events/Show/57106).
- **Sunday Lunch (Arena OK Linné):** Hearty homemade soup with sandwich (regular or vegetarian), 85 SEK. Pre-order via [Eventor Long](https://eventor.orientering.se/Events/Show/57107).

_For dietary requirements or enquiries, contact Race Director Lars Pontén: `lars.ponten@gmail.com`._

